        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 748BD/592/4, Classic Beaded Leverset with Beaded Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Beaded Leverset is a lovely addition to historic homes. All critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia Beaded Door Lever with Mortise:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Does not Fit standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore holes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i> Special Ordered Item <b>No Returns</b></i>\r\n</p>",
